===Devices using this module (some)=== Per a C2PC made 10/21/2013, the ''Dell'' T01D :<small>(regulatory model, type T01D001)</small> Tablet PC QCA6234 is a combo module which :consists of AR6004 and AR3002 It's used in some of Amazon products, such as: *Kindle Fire HD, Amazon Fire TV, Amazon Echo
